(text "LOCAL 3.3 V / 8 MHz ACQUISITION\nADC and MCU reference FCOM. Program only with an isolated programmer\nand the bias physically disconnected and verified discharged." (at 15.24 15.24 0) (effects (font (size 1.25 1.25)) (justify left top)) (uuid "aa3266d2-5ae9-5860-92ba-e6435381d7c7"))
(text "Two VO2611-X016 wide DIP optical channels. UART idle high.\nTransmitter low sinks LED current; receiver output goes low.\nHost GPIO17 = request TX; GPIO16 = reply RX; 38400 baud, 8N1.\nNo conductive UART or I2C connection crosses the 5 mm copper gap." (at 210.82 15.24 0) (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left top)) (uuid "7a413b40-e751-5c67-b6d2-8957459d5bfc"))
